; --- Act 5: the gorge river. The first Drone, fought inside its own murk. -----
; DOWNSTREAM of GorgeArch, not under it. Under the arch reads better and does
; not work: the arch's underside is 5.0 m up and the route's next move is a
; three-and-a-half metre rise to the surface, so a fight that ends beneath it
; leaves the player rising into stone. The flown route found that in one pass
; and it is the kind of thing only a flown route finds.
[node name="RunoffDroneGorge" type="Area3D" parent="." groups=["enemy"]]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 3.6, -105.8)
metadata/enemy_id = "runoff_drone"

